SUMMARY:Tai Chi
DTSTAMP:20260814T042941Z
DTSTART:20260815T150000Z
DESCRIPTION:Nurture your strength and mental health with Tai Chi at Parker 
	Williams Library! Often described as 'meditation in motion'\, Tai Chi is a
	 low-impact\, slow-motion exercise that helps to strengthen your muscles a
