UID:LheNubPcNqEWm4UnSRDJm
SUMMARY:Sound Bath with Daemein Smith (Prioritizing Peace)
DTSTAMP:20260814T042942Z
DTSTART:20260905T080000Z
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a peaceful morning experience in Hermann Park with 
	a free guided Sound Bath led by Daemein Smith of Prioritizing Peace. Set a
	gainst the natural beauty of the Tsuru Family Terrace in the Commons\, thi
	s immersive meditation experience uses sound and vibration to promote rela
	xation\, mindfulness\, and emotional well-being. Guests are encouraged to 
	slow down\, reset\, and “Prioritize Peace” through a calming journey of so
	und healing in nature. \n Tsuru Family Terrace\n Saturday\, September 5\n 
	8 – 9 a.m.\n Free Community Session \nGuests are encouraged to bring a yog
	a mat if available. Blankets and pillows are also recommended for addition
	al comfort. All ages and experience levels welcome. \nParking: Free parkin
	g available across the street from the Commons in Lot S (6215 Main St\, Ho
	uston\, TX 77030). Additional street parking available along Main Street.\
	n\nhttps://hermannpark.org/event/sound-bath-with-daemein-smith-prioritizin
	g-peace-11/\n\nFrom Hermann Park Conservancy
URL:https://hermannpark.org/event/sound-bath-with-daemein-smith-prioritizin
	g-peace-11/
LOCATION:The Commons
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:hermann-park
CATEGORIES:Hermann Park Conservancy
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT1H
END:VEVENT
