UID:YLJgaPRtNmQVfLOLB_iju
SUMMARY:TexRenFest - Pirate Adventure\, FREE for Members
DTSTAMP:20260814T042942Z
DTSTART:20261024T134500Z
DESCRIPTION:[social]\nThe Texas Renaissance Festival is the nation's larges
	t\, most acclaimed Renaissance theme park. Open to the public every weeken
	d in the fall\, it's an exciting exploration of yesteryear - thrill to the
	 charge of knights jousting on their mighty steeds. Fall under the spell o
	f the faery court. Laugh and be amazed at the clowns\, jugglers\, acrobats
	\, and magicians performing on stages throughout the village\, or watch wi
	th excitement as birds of prey soar through the air. Stay till dark and de
	light in the fire show and Royal Fireworks every festival evening!\n\nhttp
	s://htxoutdoors.com/events/texrenfest-pirate-adventure-free-for-members-2/
	\n\nFrom HTXoutdoors
URL:https://htxoutdoors.com/events/texrenfest-pirate-adventure-free-for-mem
	bers-2/
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:htxoutdoors
CATEGORIES:HTXoutdoors
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT10H15M
END:VEVENT
